WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:11.790
Everyone got ready for the contest.

2
00:00:11.791 --> 00:00:18.836
Noodles jumped rope.

3
00:00:18.837 --> 00:00:27.979
Popcorn did push-ups.

4
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:37.567
Pickle did sit-ups.

5
00:00:37.568 --> 00:00:42.750
Cupcake made a scoreboard.

6
00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:46.519
"This is silly," Berry said.

7
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.309
"We don't need a contest."

8
00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:57.799
"Hmph! Yes, we do!"

9
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.899
Cupcake got forks.

10
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:10.838
"It's late," Berry said.

11
00:01:10.839 --> 00:01:14.982
"Let's go to sleep."

12
00:01:14.983 --> 00:01:25.154
"No way!" Cupcake kept working.

13
00:01:25.155 --> 00:01:34.575
Berry sighed.

14
00:01:34.576 --> 00:01:39.584
He went to sleep.

15
00:01:39.585 --> 00:01:44.224
Cupcake lined up the forks.

16
00:01:44.225 --> 00:01:47.518
"We can jump over these.

17
00:01:47.519 --> 00:01:57.622
Now I'll set up a racecourse."

18
00:01:57.623 --> 00:02:05.157
The others came over.

19
00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:11.137
"Oww. This racecourse is no good," Popcorn said.

20
00:02:11.138 --> 00:02:19.537
"We'll bump into the trash can."

21
00:02:19.538 --> 00:02:25.416
"And I won't jump over forks," Noodles said.

22
00:02:25.417 --> 00:02:38.385
"I might get tangled!"

23
00:02:38.386 --> 00:02:43.821
"Huh?" Pickle saw the scoreboard.

24
00:02:43.822 --> 00:02:55.199
"Ugh. Cupcake, why is your name on top?"

25
00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:04.127
They argued and argued.

26
00:03:04.128 --> 00:03:12.929
Berry slept in his tent.

